OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FSarah Summers hosts the last
OL,7,     Fvisit, at The Barn at Dale End
OL,8,     FHouse, near Matlock in the Peak
OL,9,     FDistrict. Sarah's dreading
OL,10,     FRobert's arrival, but all of her
OL,11,     Fguests are bowled over by her B&B.
OL,12,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThere's harsh criticism,
OL,14,     Faccusations of play-acting and
OL,15,     Ftears on the last day of the
OL,16,     Fcompetition, as the B&Bers meet
OL,17,     Ffor the last time, to find out how
OL,18,     Fmuch they've been paid and who's
OL,19,     Fwon.
