OL,5,G2305 The Emergency Ward
OL,6,     FDr Mya and Dr David treat a young
OL,7,     Fwoman with a broken jaw who is in
OL,8,     Fa world of pain and at risk of
OL,9,     Fchoking after falling off her
OL,10,     Fhorse.
OL,11,G0005 The Emergency Ward
OL,12,     FDr Michelle and Dr Emma are on
OL,13,     Fhigh alert for a mother-to-be who
OL,14,     Fis partly paralysed and
OL,15,     Funresponsive from a suspected
OL,16,     Fstroke. And a critically injured
OL,17,     Fpatient fights for his life.
